   "meaningful":
   "∀ (x : ℝ),\n  0 < x →\n    (0 < x ∧ ¬x = 0) ∧\n      (f x - 2 = x + 1 / x - 2 → (¬x = 0 ∧ ¬x = 0) ∧ (x + 1 / x - 2 = (x ^ 2 - 2 * x + 1) / x → ¬x = 0 ∧ ¬x = 0))",
